        "content": "Find operational incidents across clusters. The main views follow all filters. Dedicated Pod, Host and Event views use their own source and applicable filters. Quiet services may have no logs. SQL and data-bearing records are intentionally excluded. Each log view is capped at 500 lines, narrow the time range or use Explore for more.\n\nGreen, amber and red indicate explicit status. Blue is quantitative emphasis. N/A means missing or unsupported data, never healthy zero.",
